IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `model-constitution-domain`

§ `Second Schedule — Model Constitution for a Company Limited by Guarantee`

-- ===========================================================================
-- Companies (Model Constitutions) Regulations 2015 (S 833/2015),
-- Second Schedule (Regulation 3), regs 1–68.
--
-- This is the default constitution for a company limited by guarantee
-- in Singapore. Such companies have no share capital; members
-- guarantee contributions up to a capped amount on winding up.
--
-- Source: SSO current version as at 07 Sep 2026.
-- ===========================================================================


§§ `Membership — reg 8`

-- reg 8(1): member may withdraw with 7 days' notice
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 8(1)"
`membership withdrawal notice days` MEANS 7


§§ `General meeting — regs 9–12`

-- reg 11(1): at least 14 days' notice for general meetings
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 11(1)"
`guarantee co general meeting notice days` MEANS 14


§§ `Proceedings at general meetings — regs 13–26`


§§§ `reg 13 — Quorum`

-- reg 13(2): default quorum — 2 members present in person
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 13(2)"
`guarantee co general meeting quorum` MEANS 2


§§§ `reg 14 — No quorum within half an hour`

@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 14"
`guarantee co quorum grace period minutes` MEANS 30


§§§ `reg 15 — Chairman`

-- reg 15(b)(ii): chairman must arrive within 15 minutes
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 15(b)(ii)"
`guarantee co chairman arrival grace minutes` MEANS 15


§§§ `reg 16 — Adjournment`

-- reg 16(3): notice required if adjourned meeting > 30 days after original
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 16(3)"
`guarantee co adjournment notice threshold days` MEANS 30


§§§ `reg 17 — Voting and poll demand`

-- reg 17(1): poll may be demanded by:
-- (b) at least 3 members present in person or by proxy
-- (c) member(s) representing >= 5% of total voting rights
-- Note: no paid-up share test (no share capital)
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 17(1)"
GIVEN `members demanding poll`         IS A NUMBER
    , `voting rights pct of demanders` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may demand poll guarantee co` IF
    `members demanding poll` AT LEAST 3
    OR `voting rights pct of demanders` AT LEAST 5


§§§ `reg 19 — Casting vote`

@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 19"
GIVEN `votes for`          IS A NUMBER
    , `votes against`       IS A NUMBER
    , `chairman votes for`  IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `guarantee co resolution carried with casting vote` IF
    `votes for` GREATER THAN `votes against`
    OR (`votes for` EQUALS `votes against` AND `chairman votes for`)


§§§ `reg 20 — Votes`

-- reg 20(2): show of hands — 1 vote per member
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 20(2)"
`guarantee co votes per member show of hands` MEANS 1

-- reg 20(3): poll — 1 vote per member (no shares)
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 20(3)"
`guarantee co votes per member on poll` MEANS 1


§§§ `reg 25 — Proxy deposit deadline`

-- reg 25(2)(a): proxy for poll — at least 24 hours before
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 25(2)(a)"
`guarantee co proxy deposit hours before poll` MEANS 24

-- reg 25(2)(b): proxy for meeting — at least 72 hours before
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 25(2)(b)"
`guarantee co proxy deposit hours before meeting` MEANS 72


§§ `Directors — regs 27–35`


§§§ `reg 27 — Rotation of directors`

-- reg 27(2): at subsequent AGMs, 1/3 of directors retire
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 27(2)"
GIVEN `number of directors` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `guarantee co directors to retire at AGM` IS
    `number of directors` DIVIDED BY 3


§§§ `reg 35 — Vacancy of office`

-- reg 35(h): absent > 6 months without permission
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 35(h)"
`guarantee co director absence vacancy months` MEANS 6


§§ `Proceedings of directors — regs 42–53`


§§§ `reg 45 — Directors' quorum`

-- reg 45: default quorum for directors is 2
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 45"
`guarantee co directors meeting quorum` MEANS 2


§§§ `reg 47 — Chairman grace period`

-- reg 47(2): chairman must arrive within 10 minutes
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 47(2)"
`guarantee co directors chairman arrival minutes` MEANS 10


§§ `Indemnity — regs 65–66`


§§§ `reg 65 — Officer indemnity`

-- reg 65: officer indemnified except for liability under s 172B(1)(a) or (b)
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 65"
GIVEN `is liability to company`  IS A BOOLEAN
    , `is criminal fine`         IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `guarantee co officer indemnity available` IF
    NOT `is liability to company`
    AND NOT `is criminal fine`


§§ `Income and property — reg 67`

-- reg 67(1): income applied solely to objects, not distributed to members
-- (declaratory — no computable threshold, but the principle is absolute)


§§ `Dissolution — reg 68`

-- reg 68: dissolution requires special resolution + majority of board
-- Special resolution threshold is set by the Act (75%)
@ref "S 833/2015, Second Schedule, reg 68(1)"
GIVEN `special resolution passed`      IS A BOOLEAN
    , `directors voting for`            IS A NUMBER
    , `total directors`                 IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `guarantee co dissolution approved` IF
    `special resolution passed`
    AND `directors voting for` GREATER THAN (`total directors` DIVIDED BY 2)


-- ===========================================================================
-- TEST CASES
-- ===========================================================================

§§ `Second Schedule — Illustrations`


-- reg 8: membership withdrawal
#ASSERT `membership withdrawal notice days` EQUALS 7

-- reg 11: general meeting notice
#ASSERT `guarantee co general meeting notice days` EQUALS 14

-- reg 13: quorum
#ASSERT `guarantee co general meeting quorum` EQUALS 2

-- reg 17: poll demand
#ASSERT `may demand poll guarantee co` 3 0
#ASSERT `may demand poll guarantee co` 1 5
#ASSERT NOT (`may demand poll guarantee co` 2 4)

-- reg 19: casting vote
#ASSERT `guarantee co resolution carried with casting vote` 60 40 TRUE
#ASSERT `guarantee co resolution carried with casting vote` 50 50 TRUE
#ASSERT NOT (`guarantee co resolution carried with casting vote` 50 50 FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`guarantee co resolution carried with casting vote` 40 60 TRUE)

-- reg 20: votes
#ASSERT `guarantee co votes per member show of hands` EQUALS 1
#ASSERT `guarantee co votes per member on poll` EQUALS 1

-- reg 25: proxy deposit
#ASSERT `guarantee co proxy deposit hours before poll` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `guarantee co proxy deposit hours before meeting` EQUALS 72

-- reg 35: director absence
#ASSERT `guarantee co director absence vacancy months` EQUALS 6

-- reg 45: directors quorum
#ASSERT `guarantee co directors meeting quorum` EQUALS 2

-- reg 65: officer indemnity
#ASSERT `guarantee co officer indemnity available` FALSE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`guarantee co officer indemnity available` TRUE FALSE)
#ASSERT NOT (`guarantee co officer indemnity available` FALSE TRUE)

-- reg 68: dissolution
#ASSERT `guarantee co dissolution approved` TRUE 3 4
#ASSERT NOT (`guarantee co dissolution approved` FALSE 3 4)
#ASSERT NOT (`guarantee co dissolution approved` TRUE 2 4)
